# Kilo ignore file — standard .gitignore syntax
# Derived from .clineignore, adapted for FuseCP's Kilo workflow.
# NOTE: JSON/YAML patterns are intentionally omitted so .csproj,
#       appsettings.json, kilo.jsonc, and other critical configs remain readable.

# --- Build artifacts ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/Release/
**/Debug/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/out/
**/publish/
**/artifacts/
build/
.next/
.vite/
.vscode-test/

# --- Dependencies & packages ---
**/packages/
**/node_modules/
**/bower_components/
**/vendor/
*.nupkg

# --- Logs, databases, and local state ---
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.db
*.ldf
*.mdf
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# --- Temporary / cache folders ---
**/.cache/
**/.npm/
**/.yarn/
**/dist/
**/out/

# --- Compiled / binary artifacts ---
*.lock
*.map
*.pdb
*.dll
*.exe
*.so
*.dylib

# --- Version control metadata ---
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# --- Image and media assets ---
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*.gif
*.ico
*.woff
*.woff2
*.eot
*.ttf
*.mp4
*.mp3

# --- Compiled CSS output (rebuild from LESS source) ---
**/main.css

# --- EF migration install scripts (generated artifacts) ---
**/install.*.sql

# --- EF migrations (large generated text blocks) ---
Migrations/
migrations/

# --- Static asset directories ---
wwwroot/
assets/
static/
public/

# --- Test snapshots ---
__snapshots__/

# --- FuseCP project-specific generated / local state ---
**/bin_dotnet/
**/TestResults/
appsettings.hardened.json
.fake

# Keep Kilo configuration directory accessible
!.kilo/
